All the visible windows use the Base_window abstraction that exists in the [Utils](https://github.com/SrMeissel/Vulkan-Engine-Editor/blob/400dca64f59240c19125be5a9da5616846925f12/Editor/Utils.h) header. The resolution is initially set when the _Create_ function is used. 
